          "vector_score": 0.7578783261143935,
          "keyword_score": null
        }
      ],
      "answer": {
        "answer": "The AI RMF does not prescribe a universal risk tolerance; rather, risk tolerance and the level of acceptable risk are highly contextual and specific to the particular application and use-case. Acceptable risk and risk tolerance can be influenced by legal or regulatory requirements, policies and norms established by AI system owners, organizations, industries, communities, or policy makers, as well as an organization's particular priorities and resource considerations.",
        "citations": [
          {
            "doc_id": "7576edb531d9848825814ee88e28b1795d3a84b435b4b797d3670eafdc4a89f1",
            "page": 12,
            "quote": "While the AI RMF can be used to prioritize risk, it does not prescribe risk tolerance.",
            "document_title": "NIST AI Risk Management Framework 1.0",
            "source": "National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST AI 100-1, January 2023)",
            "source_url": "https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/nist.ai.100-1.pdf",
            "chunk_id": 16,
            "chunk_index": 0
          },
          {
            "doc_id": "7576edb531d9848825814ee88e28b1795d3a84b435b4b797d3670eafdc4a89f1",
            "page": 12,
            "quote": "Risk tolerance and the level of risk that is acceptable to organizations or society are highly contextual and application and use-case specific. Risk tolerances can be influenced by policies and norms established by AI sys- tem owners, organizations, industries, communities, or policy makers.",
            "document_title": "NIST AI Risk Management Framework 1.0",
            "source": "National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST AI 100-1, January 2023)",
            "source_url": "https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/nist.ai.100-1.pdf",
            "chunk_id": 16,
            "chunk_index": 0
          },
          {
            "doc_id": "7576edb531d9848825814ee88e28b1795d3a84b435b4b797d3670eafdc4a89f1",
            "page": 12,
            "quote": "Risk tolerance can be influenced by legal or regula- tory requirements",
            "document_title": "NIST AI Risk Management Framework 1.0",
            "source": "National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST AI 100-1, January 2023)",
            "source_url": "https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/ai/nist.ai.100-1.pdf",
            "chunk_id": 16,
            "chunk_index": 0
          },
          {
            "doc_id": "7576edb531d9848825814ee88e28b1795d3a84b435b4b797d3670eafdc4a89f1",
            "page": 12,
            "quote": "Different organiza- tions may have varied risk tolerances due to their particular organizational priorities and resource considerations.",
            "document_title": "NIST AI Risk Management Framework 1.0",
